Source: https://github.com/DalsinAI/openamigawrite

New in 1.0.2: DOCX and ODT files saved on the Amiga by 1.0.1 were
corrupt; they are right now (please update). Also: Find shows the match,
table lines in the document's colours, paragraph and cell shading and
borders kept, and better PDF and HTML export (pictures, tables, footers).

New in 1.0.1: bullets and other non-Latin-1 characters drawn correctly,
table rows aligned, coloured text, exact sizes from outline fonts (no lost
full stops in small type), transparent pictures, and no text drawn over
pictures or left with stray blank lines. See Release-Notes.txt.
